        {
          "checked": true,
          "line_num": 524,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Plan written up in `docs/try-sage-deployment.md`, \"Planned: keys from the vault\" (2026-11-04)"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 525,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "try.sage: its keys are pasted by hand into CapRover's env panel; `make deploy`, already under `sage-secret`, pushes the resolved `TRY_SAGE_*` values through CapRover's API, so a rotation is a vault edit plus a deploy"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 526,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Per cluster: one collection and one machine account each, its credentials on that cluster, not this Mac's Keychain; the `sage-box` files in `~/.sage-is/boxes/` already hold only `bw:` references"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 527,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Names: `bw:ITEM` resolves by name across all an account sees, so an account that sees several clusters needs prefixed names (`realtor-m-*` does this today)"
        }
      ],
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
