        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 534,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "[WE] Sandboxed frame like `Artifacts.svelte` (`srcdoc`, `allow-scripts`, no `allow-same-origin`); the host checks `event.source`, since such a frame's messages arrive with origin `\"null\"`"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 535,
          "tags": [],
