      "text": "**Move Realtor M off the shared demo box onto his own AI-UI (decided 2026-07-30): it ends tenant cleanup, uncapped shared spend, and his data beside strangers'. Since 2026-10-04 it runs on his own Mac (private Trellis board, card \"Realtor M's Mac mini\").**\n- [x] His AI-UI is up on the box, :8080, loopback only (2026-10-20)\n- [ ] [MANUALLY] The Cloudflare Tunnel on a startr.cloud codename host behind Access (decided 2026-10-22; his domain later); then he signs in there, not on try.sage.is\n\n`TODO.md:L172`",
