    {
      "children": [
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 247,
          "tags": [
            "#critical"
          ],
          "text": "**The 2.3.0 driver recurred verbatim in 3.1.0 (2026-08-10)**: second occurrence of a known, carded failure mode."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 248,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "2.3.0: buildx OOMed mid-push \u2014 tag on origin with no GHCR image."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 249,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "3.1.0: `release_finish` pushed tag `v3.1.0`, then the build failed \u2014 tag published, no matching GHCR image, the exact state this card was opened for."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 250,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Recovery was hand-driven: `it_build_multi_arch_push_GHCR`, then `verify_ghcr_manifest`, then `_pin_server_tag`."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 251,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "**`wizard_smoke` cold-cache false-fail (2.3.2, 2026-05-29)**: 15-min `INSTALL_TIMEOUT_SEC` too short for ~5 GB wheels + ~2 GB embedding model \u2014 evaluate, any removes the failure at the root:"
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 252,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Smoke false-failed on residential bandwidth while uv downloaded and `models/status` showed `error: null`."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 253,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "`SKIP_SMOKE=1` is NOT poka-yoke; until a root fix ships, a cold-cache false-fail blocks the release \u2014 the gate doing its job."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 254,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Bake uv wheel cache + embedding model into the smoke image at build time (image grows ~5-7 GB; smoke turns deterministic, runs in minutes)."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 255,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Move smoke to the staging CapRover app once it exists (datacenter bandwidth; ties into the 2.3.3 staging-smoke design)."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 256,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Make smoke resumable across container restarts."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 257,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "**Both ratchets are unrunnable on a fresh clone (2026-08-12)** #critical: `cognitive_complexity` and `chat_path_structure` hard-fail \"no baseline\" on every clone and CI runner, and `make lint` fails with them."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 258,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "`.gitignore:46` excludes `/scripts/gates/*/baseline.json` and none was ever committed."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 259,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Baselines stay out of git (Alexander, 2026-08-12); `chat_path_structure_teeth` stays in `gauntlet_fast`."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 260,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Remaining: either track the baselines or drop the ratchets from every rollup \u2014 a fresh clone still starts fence-less, and ceilings seeded from a regressed tree bless the regression."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 261,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "**Dependency-CVE scanning belongs on CI loop, not commit hook** (deferred 2026-08-12): keep the hook as lockfile early warning; stop counting it as CVE coverage."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 262,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "`audit-deps` gates on `files: (bun\\.lock|requirements\\.txt)$`, so a CVE against an untouched dependency never triggers it \u2014 the normal case."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 263,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "`always_run` is the wrong device (trivy every commit, staleness untouched)."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 264,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Schedule `make scan_deps` + `scan_container` on a CI runner (see Gitea-vs-Woodpecker)."
        },
        {
          "checked": true,
          "line_num": 265,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "_1 done step archived 2026-11-03 \u2192 docs/completed-todos.md._"
        }
      ],
