          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 67,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "[MANUALLY] Sitting 2 of the plan's decision queue: what tool servers receive and direct connections (before F3), Space rules (before F4), the default embedder and the Sprig questions (before F5)"
