    {
      "children": [
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 627,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Three stacked sources on :8099: grafted `sprig-theme:workshop-bio` (`/themes/active.css`) sets `--primary/--secondary/--links` as GREEN LITERALS + a green-tinted `--color-gray-N` scale; the layout sets inline purple `--primary/--secondary` (wins those two); stock startr.style derives `--links: var(--primary)`."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 629,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Root cause: the Sprig's literal `--links` SEVERS the framework cascade, so inline `--primary` never reaches links; the tinted gray scale covers most surface regardless."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 630,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Upstream (first-party) fix: theme Sprigs must author `--links: var(--primary)`, not literals \u2014 keeps grafted themes brandable; fix `workshop-bio` + the authoring contract in the sprig spec."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 633,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Guard: e2e asserts a saved color reaches BOTH a SPA and a no-build page; the drift class is \"one consumer honors config, the other silently doesn't\"."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 634,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Inline `<style>` stays CSP-compatible today (`'unsafe-inline'` kept per the CSP card); note in the policy's exception list when that ships."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 635,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Found on the way: the no-build shell never loads `/themes/active.css` \u2014 a grafted theme dresses the SPA and NOT the server-rendered panels. Decide whether the shell links it (theme parity) or stays deliberately unthemed; today's fix gates shell colors on `SPRIG_ACTIVE_THEME` so the two surfaces at least agree on who wins."
        },
        {
          "checked": true,
          "line_num": 636,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "_3 done steps archived 2026-11-03 \u2192 docs/completed-todos.md._"
        }
      ],
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
