          "line_num": 678,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "The content-delta close ([middleware.py:2003](app/backend/sage_is_ai/utils/middleware.py#L2003)) sends no serialized snapshot with the flag on ([middleware.py:2065](app/backend/sage_is_ai/utils/middleware.py#L2065)), so the last one the browser got says `done=\"false\"`."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 679,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "DB is correct both ways (`done=\"true\" duration=\"1\"`; oracle replay of `reasoning-field-then-content.sse`)."
        },
        {
          "checked": true,
          "line_num": 680,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Re-checked 2026-11-04 after the reasoning fix: still true. A flag-on replay of `reasoning-field-then-content.sse` keeps `done=\"false\"` until the final event."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 681,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Flag on breaks two more paths (same replay): `reasoning-tag-inline.sse` shows raw `<think>\u2026</think>` text until the end; after a field close ([middleware.py:1975](app/backend/sage_is_ai/utils/middleware.py#L1975)) the answer freezes at its first fragment, since later `reasoning_content` deltas ship raw."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 682,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Proposed fix: the flag decides only per-delta DB saves; the browser always gets serialized blocks. Pin it with flag-on oracle cases for the three streams (`realtime-save-on` covers only `plain-text.sse`)."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 685,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "[MANUALLY] Check the flag on try.sage.is before deciding severity. Default `False` ([env.py:331](app/backend/sage_is_ai/env.py#L331)), absent from the docs' CapRover block; `cr-deploy apps try-sage-is` needs the captain password (token expired 2026-11-04)."
        }
      ],
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "99072418bea1b00e",
      "line_num": 675,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#bug"
      ],
      "text": "**`ENABLE_REALTIME_CHAT_SAVE=true` leaves reasoning stuck on \"Thinking\u2026\" for the whole generation: the flag changes what the browser receives, and the reasoning close rides the first content delta \u2014 the disclosure spins until the terminal `done: True` event. ([dossier](docs/board-dossiers.md))**\n- [ ] Flag on: text deltas ship raw and the frontend appends `choices[0].delta.content` ([Chat.svelte:1241](app/src/lib/components/chat/Chat.svelte#L1241)).\n- [ ] Flag off: the frontend replaces serialized blocks ([Chat.svelte:1275](app/src/lib/components/chat/Chat.svelte#L1275)).\n- [ ] The content-delta close ([middleware.py:2003](app/backend/sage_is_ai/utils/middleware.py#L2003)) sends no serialized snapshot with the flag on ([middleware.py:2065](app/backend/sage_is_ai/utils/middleware.py#L2065)), so the last one the browser got says `done=\"false\"`.\n- [ ] DB is correct both ways (`done=\"true\" duration=\"1\"`; oracle replay of `reasoning-field-then-content.sse`).\n- [x] Re-checked 2026-11-04 after the reasoning fix: still true. A flag-on replay of `reasoning-field-then-content.sse` keeps `done=\"false\"` until the final event.\n- [ ] Flag on breaks two more paths (same replay): `reasoning-tag-inline.sse` shows raw `<think>\u2026</think>` text until the end; after a field close ([middleware.py:1975](app/backend/sage_is_ai/utils/middleware.py#L1975)) the answer freezes at its first fragment, since later `reasoning_content` deltas ship raw.\n- [ ] Proposed fix: the flag decides only per-delta DB saves; the browser always gets serialized blocks. Pin it with flag-on oracle cases for the three streams (`realtime-save-on` covers only `plain-text.sse`).\n- [ ] [MANUALLY] Check the flag on try.sage.is before deciding severity. Default `False` ([env.py:331](app/backend/sage_is_ai/env.py#L331)), absent from the docs' CapRover block; `cr-deploy apps try-sage-is` needs the captain password (token expired 2026-11-04).\n\n`#bug`\n`TODO.md:L675`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 1140
    },
    {
