      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#bug"
      ],
      "text": "**A partial tag reaches the reader for one frame: when a chunk boundary splits a reasoning tag, the loop emits the fragment raw before the next chunk completes it \u2014 cosmetic and brief, but visible.**\n- [ ] The `reasoning-tag-inline` oracle golden records a first event whose entire content is `<thin`.\n\n`#bug`\n`TODO.md:L686`",
