      ],
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "ad005b0c0822a18a",
      "line_num": 703,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#bug",
        "#critical-gate"
      ],
      "text": "**The changelog pager spec passes whether the button moves or not: `wizard-changelog.cy.ts` was green against the broken transform version AND the working `margin-left` version \u2014 the gap is the environment, not the assertion.**\n- [ ] Spec under test: \"moves to the other side once the notes run out\".\n- [ ] The assertion has teeth against a zero shift: forcing 0 went RED \u2014 `expected 0 to be above 367.5`.\n- [ ] What it missed: a transform that applied under the driver but not in the operator's browser.\n- [ ] Decide: make the check discriminate in a real engine, or drop the claim and say the spec covers paging and the label only.\n- [ ] SikuliX is on the roadmap for exactly this class.\n\n`#bug` `#critical-gate`\n`TODO.md:L703`",
