      "line_num": 285,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**The duplication sweep, batch 2 (2026-08-08, at Alexander's push \u2014 \"I'm confident you can find many other similar issues\"): a 20-agent find-and-refute workflow surfaced 36 findings; 7 survived refutation and landed, 1 was killed, 10 are behaviour-class. Landed: `get_available_models` (12 byte-identical six-liners across 5 files), `persist_message` (10 sites), the follow-ups/tags task runner, `emit_event` (8 sites), `merge_custom_params` (3 verbatim copies incl. 2 in payload.py), the nested `continue_stream_round` (the continuation tails, fence-safe this time because it nests), and `resolve_task_model_id` (9 four-argument spellings). Oracle byte-identical after every edit; `except: pass` fell 5 \u2192 3 because the task-runner merge collapsed two swallows into one. middleware 2,282 \u2192 2,227 lines; `max_function_lines` 895 \u2192 852; `deep_lines` 566 \u2192 501; cognitive worst 386 \u2192 357; plus ~105 lines out of tasks.py/chat.py/embeddings.py/payload.py \u2014**\n`charts/chat-path-restructure/TODO.md:L285`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 1410
